  <entity01238169:DescriptionOfIncreaseDecreaseThroughOtherChangesPropertyPlantAndEquipmentOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutPropertyPlantAndEquipmentLineItemsOfDisclosureOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">기타에는 전기 중 해외 소재 종속기업의 외화환산으로 인한 변동 등이 포함되어 있습니다.</entity01238169:DescriptionOfIncreaseDecreaseThroughOtherChangesPropertyPlantAndEquipmentOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutPropertyPlantAndEquipmentLineItemsOfDisclosureOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTableOfItems>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity01238169_CommitmentsToPurchasePropertyPlantAndEquipmentMemberOfPurchaseCommitmentMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsToPurchasePropertyPlantAndEquipmentTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당기말 현재 연결실체는 건물 및 기계장치 등과 관련하여 매입약정 등을 체결하고 있으며, 이와 관련하여 향후 추가적으로 지출될 것으로 예상되는 금액은 296,704 백만원(전기말: 11,454백만원)입니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
