  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity01238169_OtherCommitments2MemberOfOtherCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당기말 현재 연결실체의 지배기업인 (주)오리온홀딩스와 종속회사인 Orion FoodCo., Ltd.는 Shandong Lukang Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd.와 합자투자계약을 체결하고 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
